      "openalex_id": "W2269122524",
      "doi": "10.1111/ejop.12131",
      "title": "Transcendental Philosophy and Intersubjectivity: Mutual Recognition as a Condition for the Possibility of Self\u2010Consciousness in Sections 1\u20133 of Fichte's Foundations of Natural Right",
      "authors": [
        {
